            "id": "claim_c16a601638ba44d0bf465666f13dfeac",
            "statement": "After validation, `AudioEngine.init()` creates a `SoundRegistry` from every sprite-manifest entry's URL, passes its map to `SoundController`, and resolves registry URLs through the buffer cache when creating ordinary sound instances; registry membership therefore does not establish that a decoded buffer is available.",
