            "id": "claim_f6675ac600464d49b0d29bc2996c63b4",
            "statement": "Validation runs against the aggregate configuration before runtime composition completes. In strict mode an invalid result emits `engine:error` with `INIT_FAILED` and returns; in non-strict mode initialization warns and proceeds.",
